### Description
Being faced this unexpected behavior I found corresponding [thread on stackoverflow.com from 2013](https://stackoverflow.com/a/19392562/2336304)
[Reproducing on .Net 5: https://dotnetfiddle.net/zT8Djq](https://dotnetfiddle.net/zT8Djq)
```
using System;
using System.Linq;
try
{
	new int[10].AsParallel().Select<int, int>(i => throw new AggregateException()).ForAll(Console.WriteLine);
}
catch (AggregateException)
{
	Console.WriteLine("Expected");
}
catch (ObjectDisposedException)
{
	Console.WriteLine("Bug");
}
```
The code prints "Bug" when "Expected" expected.

The problem is caused by QueryTaskGroupState.QueryEnd() implementation.
